SAMATWAM — The Outline and the Record

Typeface
  Jost (variable), by Owen Earl (indestructible type*). SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/jost

Music and sound
  All synthesized in code (mix.py): marimba, vibraphone, kalimba and plucked bass by modal synthesis;
  foley from the library's procedural sfx.py. No samples, no recordings.

Picture
  Drawn in code (index.html, Canvas 2D). No images, footage or generated imagery.

Tools
  Lemo-Opuscar film library (render, mux): https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar
  FFmpeg 9 (imageio-ffmpeg build) for encoding.
